        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>￦ 4,500</choice_text>
          <commentary>4,500원은 수정 전 총비용이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>￦ 5,200</choice_text>
          <commentary>5,200원은 계산 결과와 맞지 않는다.</commentary>
